# Client POS only (this agent)

When aligning UI or behavior with Mother POS in this project:

- **Default target:** `src/OrderWeb.Client` only.
- Change Mother (`src/OrderWeb.Mother`) only when Client cannot work without a Mother API/grant/seed **and** the user asks for that, or it is clearly required.
- Shared pieces (`OrderWeb.Contracts`, `OrderWeb.SharedUI`) are OK when Client needs them.
- Do not change Mother UI for parity unless the user explicitly asks.
